{"id":"wb-6-544","name":"赤溪五洞桥","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"赤溪五洞桥","text":"赤溪五洞桥位于浙江省苍南县赤溪镇过溪村。该桥始建年代不详，南宋咸淳三年（1267年）重建。为五孔梁式石桥，南北走向，长24.6米，宽1.7米。2006年5月25日，列入第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%B5%A4%E6%BA%AA%E4%BA%94%E6%B4%9E%E6%A1%A5","revisionId":91620276,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91620276","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/159824c71d8a3a6fb62d29bf.jpg","title":"赤溪五洞桥,_2021-05-02_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E8%B5%A4%E6%BA%AA%E4%BA%94%E6%B4%9E%E6%A1%A5,_2021-05-02_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/27/%E8%B5%A4%E6%BA%AA%E4%BA%94%E6%B4%9E%E6%A1%A5%2C_2021-05-02_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​苍南赤溪五洞桥","width":320,"height":214}}